Tap here for my next video,&nbsp;
and if you enjoyed this one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:35.520
do leave a thumbs-up, I really appreciate it. 
Thanks for enjoying Pinocchio with me and hope you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:38.880
have a marvellous movie-loving week!
